public class Badge {
    private final String label;

    Badge(String label) {
        this.label = label;          // field = parameter. (label = label; does nothing.)
    }

    static String format(int n)    { return "int " + n; }
    static String format(double d) { return "double " + d; }
    static String format(Object o) { return "object " + o; }
    static String format(String s) { return "string " + s; }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(format(3));          // int 3.
        System.out.println(format(3.0));        // double 3.0.
        System.out.println(format(3L));         // double 3.0 (long widens to double).
        Object o = "hi";
        System.out.println(format(o));          // object hi (declared type Object).
        System.out.println(format("hi"));       // string hi.
        System.out.println(new Badge("VIP").label);   // VIP.
    }
}
```

| Priority | Example |
|---|---|
| exact match. | 3 to format(int). |
| widening primitive. | 3L to format(double). |
| boxing. | 3 to format(Integer) if no int version. |
| varargs. | last resort. |

